{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "904fc0be58846764d24d66cc64c2168c0ff1006a71a9f34e785ca078e3ad86cc", "ja": "（ひなたの新しい衣装が届いた。\n早速、着てもらってチェックしているのだが……）", "zh": "（小日向的新服装送到了。\n马上让她穿上试试，正在确认效果，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "07504c4c958594014abd71c4bf4231e88f739b93439743508163ada92b616abd", "ja": "{$P$}。\n新しい衣装、さっそく着てみたよぉ。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n新衣服，我马上试穿了一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7cbc8c0f1f540a4724fed41eac7d94e967e966c32e2e97d7f5645f6dd4e913b5", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。うん、よく似合ってるよ。\n明るくて可愛くて、ひなたにピッタリだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。嗯，很适合你。\n明亮又可爱，和日向特别相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "7aad9a7cb79f8e8c52c58ef30aff5de351ba5766ceb05e53cdfc309697785c82", "ja": "本当かい？　ほめられると、\n照れてしまうけども……うれしいよぉ。", "zh": "真的吗？被夸奖的话，会让人害羞……不过很开心呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "c63103e4bb48e6e504da148df658ac8c4cd54b59675a2b4e70ea90a7e06c3f0a", "ja": "この衣装、たんぽぽみたいでなまらめんこいから。\nあたし、ちょっこし緊張してるんだわ。", "zh": "因为这身服装像蒲公英一样，特别可爱。\n我稍微有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "9b0b6946552fb362acfb2acfc21856bdc24f653aee32982b41a0afa6994508f1", "ja": "うん。あたしが、こったらステキな衣装を\nもらってしまっていいんだろか……って。", "zh": "嗯。我在想，我真的可以收下\n这么漂亮的演出服吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "758d2eb6347fbc8652075ce3ed853b2376d8c9c5ea836c98adbcb14efb67c76d", "ja": "でも、せっかくあたしのために作ってくれたんだし。\nたんぽぽを見習って、どっしり構えないとだねぇ。", "zh": "不过，毕竟是特意为我做的。我要向蒲公英学习，稳稳当当地面对才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "c086216ef499e75fbb4e1b5f1a39804aaa81368649d44420b3a6584d454c50ac", "ja": "たんぽぽって、なまら根っこが深いんだわ。\nめんこいだけでなくて、しっかりしてるんだよぉ。", "zh": "蒲公英的根扎得可深了。  \n不光长得可爱，还很坚韧呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7142d41d9513bc06ed0e8fb49426029ae1db8a83baa3cadd5bc3be86c9406b71", "ja": "なるほど……確かにたんぽぽって、\nコンクリートの隙間から生えてたりするもんな。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，蒲公英有时会从水泥缝里长出来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "fb934392fc0ab37fe2bbbedce43493f6cfdd18f80e098f5fbb15dd01275350ca", "ja": "うん。だからね、あたしもたんぽぽみたいに、\nもっとしっかりせねばと思ってたんだわぁ。", "zh": "嗯。所以呀，我也一直觉得，\n自己得像蒲公英那样更加坚强才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "39f6ab9fc07a77ea27390b5449e60076d9863581e86572c181cb424557475543", "ja": "ひなたらしい考え方だな。でも、\nたんぽぽとひなたって、結構似てるんじゃないか？", "zh": "真是很有雏菊风格的想法。不过，蒲公英和小日向，其实挺像的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "d43297de3f9355f0ea5f62310ae7d7ebd27827b4d4fc6ee12f74615a82186cd1", "ja": "えっ。あたしと、たんぽぽがかい？", "zh": "诶？我和蒲公英吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5a16c5c16fcd9dc3202b5288cc7feb0bfa9261214022a929fd04fcc79dc507a7", "ja": "ああ。ひなたはたんぽぽの綿毛と同じように、\n空を飛んでこの劇場まで来たよな。飛行機に乗って。", "zh": "啊。日向就像蒲公英的绒毛一样，飞过天空来到这个剧场，对吧？是坐飞机来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fcaa61f81d71b2e26fd9b854039fe76fb33bb2ee777196a477ca530302c7ab3c", "ja": "故郷から離れた場所に根を張って、花を咲かせる。\n風に乗って飛んでくる、たんぽぽにそっくりだ。", "zh": "扎根于远离故乡的地方，绽放出花朵。\n乘着风飞来的蒲公英，和它很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "2b7cd4759f9f0ae9883b7f0659f3b1520760e8de3234a4f2f74b9b00dedee50d", "ja": "わぁ……言われてみれば、そうかもしれんねぇ。\nあたし、たんぽぽとおそろいかぁ……えへへ♪", "zh": "哇……你这么一说，好像还真是这么回事呢。\n我和蒲公英一样呀……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "c191ab227cb34d0140b7e16b45099ea47c805a551680960e6de83aa43f91102e", "ja": "{$P$}。あたし、この衣装のこと、\nますます好きになったよぉ！", "zh": "{$P$}。我越来越喜欢这套服装了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8c96b3451f0f43ee021e1d461c8abbade0d63ca79c0ab85e43cdcd05509c2f53", "ja": "それなら良かった！\n新しい衣装、たくさん着ような。", "zh": "那就好！\n多穿穿新衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "5d7fdc9d9a80d09e1ad14994bb00fa959629768e668a53d3b8c9c7f6623d244b", "ja": "うん！　たくさん着られるようにがんばるべさ。\n{$P$}、本当にありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "嗯！我会努力，争取能穿上好多新衣服的。\n{$P$}，真的谢谢你呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0174_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1594b92d1065e0fa32fcbd3cbac7f4d693c379d93464c3a1fa665bc59d4f6e0a", "ja": "（ひなたの魅力は、たんぽぽのような素朴さだ。\nしっかりと根を張れるよう、支えていかないとな）", "zh": "（小日向的魅力，是如蒲公英般朴素自然。\n我也得好好支持她，让她能够稳稳扎根才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
